I had another nifty idea.  I began to code a new class, the warmage.
I was inspired by D&D.  A Warmage is a class that excels at attack
spellcasting and is good at fighting.

I coded the following in today.  Just repeating it from memory

Starting equipment:
blessed +1 spear
+2 studded leather armor
+0 crossbow
20 +0 crossbow bolts
blessed spellbook of force bolt
Random spellbook, chosen from the following three: magic missile,
fireball, and cone of cold
Random wand, chosen from the following, from most to least likely:
striking, magic missile, fire, lightning, cold(these three an equal
chance), death(a really low chance)

Note: Can recognize the spellbooks of force bolt, drain life, magic
missile, fireball, cone of cold, and finger of death on sight.
Can recognize the wands of striking, magic missile, fire, lightning,
cold, and death on sight.

Skills:
Spear-Expert
Crossbow-Expert
Attack Spells-Expert
?

Favored spell: Fireball

Also, only humans and elves can enter this class.  In addition, you
need to be neutral or chaotic (can't be really lawful with
destructiveness).

This is all I have programmed (so far).  Help and suggestions would
definitely be appreciated.


